  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Bias and Perspective\r\n\r\n1.  Press `Randomize Selection` button multiple times. In your Activity Guide, keep track of the categories that appear in the list and their frequency.\r\n\r\n2.  In your Activity Guide, analyze the effect that images have on how data is received by users.\r\n\r\n3.  Use the **PAIR framework** (_Prompt, Analyze, Implement, Reflect_) to update the dataset or the code to address at least one **bias** or **perspective** issue that you have identified.\r\n",
    "submittable": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "split",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "ai_tutor_mode": "engineer",
    "predict_settings": {
